      "t": "Да, нормально.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "viktor",
      "t": "Извините.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's walk through it. Viktor storms into the kitchen.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "viktor",
      "t": "Так, стоять.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hold it right there.' Viktor commands the rival chef to stop.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "В чём дело?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is the matter?' She asks him what he wants.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "viktor",
      "t": "Вы украли наше блюдо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You stole our dish.' He accuses her of stealing his new recipe.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Мы его сами придумали.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We invented it ourselves.' She defends her restaurant's originality.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "viktor",
      "t": "Я так и знал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I knew it.' He feels his suspicions are confirmed.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "viktor",
      "t": "Вы ничего не можете сами.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You cannot do anything yourselves.' He insults their culinary skills.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Посмотрите на эту дату.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look at this date.' She shows him the approval date of her menu.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "viktor",
      "t": "Ну, ну.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, well.' He mutters skeptically.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Дайте мне меню, пожалуйста.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Give me the menu, please.' She asks for his menu to compare.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Вы хорошо видите?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Can you see clearly?' She asks if he can read the earlier date.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
